# oracle: fixes reaxff/bonds and reaxff/species on a dynamic group (the atoms whose scaled |vx| has a fractional part
# above 0.5, re-evaluated every 5 steps), ReaxFF RDX crystal cell without QEq (checkqeq no); species with Nrepeat 1
# (native allows a dynamic group only then); the bond and species files hold the group's atoms
# oracle-inputs: w55reax_rdx.data w55reax_rdx.control
# oracle-potentials: ffield.reax.rdx
# oracle-files: bonds.dyn species.dyn
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           real
atom_style      charge
boundary        p p p
read_data       w55reax_rdx.data
pair_style      reaxff w55reax_rdx.control checkqeq no
pair_coeff      * * ffield.reax.rdx H C O N
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check no
velocity        all create 300.0 4928459 loop geom
variable        up atom (abs(vx)*1e4-floor(abs(vx)*1e4))>0.5
group           dyn dynamic all var up every 5
variable        ndyn equal count(dyn)
timestep        0.1
fix             1 all nve
fix             4 dyn reaxff/bonds 5 bonds.dyn
fix             3 dyn reaxff/species 5 1 5 species.dyn cutoff * * 0.9 element H C O N
variable        nmole equal f_3[1]
variable        nspec equal f_3[2]
thermo_style    custom step pe ebond evdwl ke etotal press v_nmole v_nspec v_ndyn
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             30
